.TH WAIT4 3crunch "" "Crunch" "Crunch Library Manual"
.SH NAME
wait4 \- wait for a child and obtain resource usage
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <sys/wait.h>
.B pid_t wait4(pid_t process, int* status, int options, struct rusage* usage);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Waits for a child selected by process.  Status and usage may be NULL.
Options include WNOHANG, WUNTRACED, and WCONTINUED.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the child PID, zero for WNOHANG, or \-1 with errno set.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR waitpid (3crunch),
.BR wait4 (2)
